### Have you had any luck using git-annex before? (Sometimes we get tired of reading bug reports all day and a lil' positive end note does wonders)

Yes, git-annex was working fine for both "addurl" and "importfeed" on the September 2026 release, built in a similar manner (local build from Homebrew Formula).  Thanks, it's been very helpful.
